        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4Vbrf2dnA9uxPmkMEjdT5kiLKY4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/205547_InstantPotCornedBeef_mfs_step1_0097-1-95cfd6f222964fb7958665e18eb55a3a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268026/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine water, beer, and garlic in a multi-functional pressure cooker (such as Instant Pot).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/v_Uyz6azQ4hq2iTcTvOPdM4oe3Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/205547_InstantPotCornedBeef_mfs_step2_0100-1-26509c97c3574a62bae0a7acc0146829.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268026/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place trivet inside. Place brisket on the trivet and sprinkle spice packet on top. Close and lock the lid. Select high pressure according to manufacturer's instructions; set timer for 90 minutes. Allow 10 minutes for pressure to build.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9aWxbLiGj3Kd_vOi-iEYVPZNcLI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/205547_InstantPotCornedBeef_mfs_step3_0102-1-3972f5d1bc8646d499b7a6c786f6a7da.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268026/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Release pressure carefully using the quick-release method according to manufacturer's instructions, about 5 minutes. Unlock and remove the lid. Transfer brisket to a baking sheet, cover with aluminum foil, and rest for 10 to 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/O1q3zfaVLJaVQH6eGJBglJ_F5aA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/205547_InstantPotCornedBeef_mfs_step4_0135-1-5f55bee48ad74367833bf539861e9288.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268026/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
